cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: Correlated Capacity
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-10-21
authors:
  - family-names: Brisson
    given-names: Jean-François
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0000-9778-5374"
license: AGPL-3.0-only
repository-code: "https://github.com/sparkainlp-x/correlated-capacity"
abstract: >-
  Synthetic toy simulation (classical software, not physical
  holography hardware). Classification capacity of the complex
  outer-product holographic memory under correlated pattern
  families: a shared-direction family with calibrated energy
  fraction rho and a rank-R subspace family. Measures how P90
  (largest pattern count with accuracy >= 0.90) degrades as
  correlation rises -- the realistic bound that random-pattern
  capacity overstates.
keywords:
  - holographic-memory
  - capacity
  - correlated-patterns
  - classification
  - wave-computing
